{"id":12260,"slug":"maullin-se-prepara-con-un-amplio-operativo-de-seguridad-para-la-final-regional-de-anfa","title":"Maullín se prepara con un amplio operativo de seguridad para la final regional de ANFA","date":"2026-08-06T21:14:43","excerpt":"La Municipalidad de Maullín implementará un moderno sistema de televigilancia en el Estadio Municipal José Montealegre Mücke para resguardar la primera final regional de clubes ANFA entre General Baquedano y Comercio de Castro. El operativo contempla: Cámaras de alta definición al exterior y una cámara 360°, al interior Monitoreo en tiempo real desde una central […]","categories":[{"id":12,"name":"Deporte","slug":"deporte"},{"id":179,"name":"Agrupaciones Comunitarias","slug":"agrupaciones-comunitarias"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":370,"name":"Desarrollo social y comunitario","slug":"desarrollo-social-y-comunitario"},{"id":31,"name":"Equipamiento","slug":"equipamiento"},{"id":33,"name":"Innovación","slug":"innovacion"},{"id":1,"name":"Proyectos","slug":"proyectos"},{"id":34,"name":"Regional","slug":"regional"},{"id":32,"name":"Seguridad","slug":"seguridad"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/12260.webp","content":"<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La Municipalidad de Maullín implementará un moderno sistema de televigilancia en el Estadio Municipal José Montealegre Mücke para resguardar la primera final regional de clubes ANFA entre General Baquedano y Comercio de Castro.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El operativo contempla:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📹\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t5f/1/16/1f4f9.png\"/> Cámaras de alta definición al exterior y una cámara 360°, al interior</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🖥️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t81/1/16/1f5a5.png\"/> Monitoreo en tiempo real desde una central de vigilancia, instalada en el recinto .</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👮\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbb/1/16/1f46e.png\"/> Patrullajes mixtos entre Seguridad Pública Municipal y Carabineros.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚓\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/te8/1/16/1f693.png\"/> Refuerzo de los servicios policiales antes, durante y después del encuentro.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Además, La Mayor comisario de Carabineros de Maullin Pamela Sandoval recordó que estará prohibido el ingreso de bebidas alcohólicas, fuegos artificiales y elementos contundentes, haciendo un llamado a vivir esta histórica jornada como una verdadera fiesta familiar.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente: munimaullin.cl</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12262\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-01-1-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-49 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12266\" data-id=\"12266\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-02-1-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12268\" data-id=\"12268\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/estadio-04-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-